\section{Complete witnesses for the return inequalities}\label{app:return-witnesses}
The following vertex lists use binary integer encoding. Each consecutive pair differs in one coordinate, and all other pairs differ in at least two coordinates. Singleton counts are recomputed against the entire selected set.
